---
const steps = [
  ['Enter Settings','Move from the operational experience into the place where AI behavior is governed.'],
  ['Choose data scope','Select product areas, assets and specific devices the AIOps experience may observe.'],
  ['Select a specialist','Configure the AI Network, Compliance or Automation Agent according to its responsibility.'],
  ['Define authority','Set monitoring, remediation, approval, exception and escalation boundaries.'],
  ['Define operations','Configure schedules, notifications, rollback behavior, audit logging and reporting.'],
];

const agents = [
  ['AI Network Agent','Monitoring scope · alert preferences · remediation actions · polling frequency · notifications · audit logging'],
  ['Compliance Agent','Compliance scope · scan scheduling · policy management · remediation workflow · exception handling'],
  ['Automation Agent','Workflow management · task scheduling · approval workflow · notifications · error handling · rollback · audit'],
];
---

<div class="configure-journey">
  <header class="configure-hero">
    <a href="/work/agenticops#agentic-trust">← Back to Trust journey</a>
    <p>Journey 05 · Configure an AI agent</p>
    <h1>Define the operating contract before granting autonomy.</h1>
    <div><p>Configuration turns an abstract promise—“AI will help”—into explicit permissions. Administrators decide what each agent can see, when it may act, where approval is required and what evidence it must retain.</p><aside>Phase 02 · AgenticOps<br/><b>Scope before speed</b></aside></div>
  </header>

  <nav aria-label="Configure-agent journey chapters"><a href="#flow">Configuration flow</a><a href="#agents">Three specialists</a><a href="#artifact">Figma artifact</a><a href="#contract">Operating contract</a></nav>

  <section id="flow" class="configure-section">
    <p class="index">01 / Configuration flow</p><h2>Five decisions turn a generic assistant into a governed specialist.</h2>
    <div class="step-grid">{steps.map(([title,copy],index) => <article><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div>
  </section>

  <section id="agents" class="configure-section dark-section">
    <p class="index">02 / Three specialists</p><h2>One settings pattern. Three very different kinds of responsibility.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Shared interaction patterns keep configuration learnable, while each agent exposes controls that match the risk and rhythm of its work.</p>
    <div class="agent-grid">{agents.map(([name,scope],index) => <article><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{scope}</p></article>)}</div>
    <aside>“Activate” is the last switch—not the first design decision.</aside>
  </section>

  <section id="artifact" class="configure-section artifact-section">
    <p class="index">03 / Complete Figma artifact</p><h2>The complete configuration journey, preserved exactly as designed.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Scroll from AIOps data-source selection through the Network, Compliance and Automation Agent settings. Each screen makes scope, approval and accountability configurable rather than implied.</p>
    <figure><img src="/images/agentic-journeys/agentic-configure-agent-flow-2025-7.png" alt="Complete AgenticOps settings journey for configuring AIOps data sources and Network, Compliance and Automation agents" loading="eager" /><figcaption><span>2025-7 · Journey artifact</span><p>Exact export from the supplied Figma artboard. The Cisco interface screens remain unchanged.</p></figcaption></figure>
  </section>

  <section id="contract" class="configure-section contract-section">
    <p class="index">04 / Operating contract</p><h2>Trusted autonomy has a scope, a checkpoint and a memory.</h2>
    <div class="contract-flow"><article><span>Scope</span><b>Specify the systems, devices, data and tasks the agent may touch</b></article><i>→</i><article><span>Checkpoint</span><b>Require approval, escalation or rollback where consequences increase</b></article><i>→</i><article><span>Memory</span><b>Retain notifications, reports and audit logs for accountable action</b></article></div>
    <div class="journey-footer"><a href="/work/agenticops/journeys/manage-agent-job">← Previous · Manage agent job</a><a href="/work/agenticops#agentic-trust">All journeys</a><a href="/work/agenticops">Return to AgenticOps case study →</a></div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .configure-journey{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto;padding-bottom:110px}.configure-hero{padding:44px 0 100px}.configure-hero>a{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:95px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;text-decoration:none}.configure-hero>p,.index{color:#486fd5;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}.configure-hero h1{max-width:1120px;margin:28px 0 55px;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.075em}.configure-hero>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:60px}.configure-hero>div>p{max-width:730px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem}.configure-hero aside{padding:20px 24px;border-left:3px solid #66a85f;background:#e8f2e5;color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem}.configure-hero aside b{display:block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink);font:600 .9rem 'Manrope'}.configure-journey>nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;display:flex;gap:8px;padding:11px 0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--paper) 94%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-block:1px solid var(--line);overflow:auto}.configure-journey>nav a{padding:8px 11px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}.configure-section{scroll-margin-top:70px;padding:100px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.configure-section h2{max-width:1030px;margin:22px 0 40px;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5rem)}.lead{max-width:860px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}.step-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:9px;margin-top:55px}.step-grid article{min-height:245px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--paper-bright);border-top:3px solid #66a85f}.step-grid span{color:#4a8645;font-size:.64rem}.step-grid h3{margin:32px 0 16px;font-size:1.08rem}.step-grid p{margin:auto 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem}.dark-section{margin-inline:calc((100vw - min(1180px,calc(100vw - 48px)))/-2);padding-inline:max(24px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2));background:#111827;color:white;border:0}.dark-section .index{color:#8fcf87}.dark-section .lead{color:#aeb8ca}.agent-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:55px}.agent-grid article{min-height:235px;padding:25px;background:#1c2638;border-top:3px solid #77bb6e}.agent-grid span{color:#8fcf87;font-size:.64rem}.agent-grid h3{margin:38px 0 28px;font-size:1.3rem}.agent-grid p{margin:0;color:#aeb8ca;font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.55}.dark-section>aside{margin-top:10px;padding:17px 20px;background:#8fcf87;color:#111827;font:600 .8rem 'Manrope'}.artifact-section figure{margin:60px 0 0;background:#444}.artifact-section img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.artifact-section figcaption{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:25px;padding:20px;background:#17243c;color:white}.artifact-section figcaption span{color:#8fcf87;font-size:.64rem;text-transform:uppercase}.artifact-section figcaption p{margin:0;color:#b5c1d2;font-size:.72rem}.contract-section{border-bottom:0}.contract-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}.contract-flow article{padding:24px;background:#e8f2e5}.contract-flow span{display:block;margin-bottom:35px;color:#4a8645;font-size:.63rem;text-transform:uppercase}.contract-flow b{font:600 .95rem/1.4 'Manrope'}.contract-flow i{align-self:center;color:#66a85f;font-style:normal}.journey-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:65px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.journey-footer a{color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem;text-decoration:none}.journey-footer a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  @media(max-width:900px){.step-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  @media(max-width:760px){.configure-journey{width:calc(100% - 32px)}.configure-hero{padding-bottom:70px}.configure-hero>a{margin-bottom:65px}.configure-hero>div,.step-grid,.agent-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.configure-section{padding:75px 0}.dark-section{margin-inline:-16px;padding-inline:16px}.artifact-section figcaption{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contract-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contract-flow i{justify-self:center;transform:rotate(90deg)}.journey-footer{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
